textile|cloth|NOUN|Woven or knitted material|Cloth made by weaving or knitting fibres.|vải; hàng dệt|The exhibition displays traditional textiles.|Triển lãm trưng bày hàng dệt truyền thống.|Countable material type; textiles plural common.|-
strictly|rigorously|ADVERB|With firm rule enforcement|In a way that closely follows or enforces rules.|nghiêm ngặt|The school strictly enforces the entrance rules.|Trường thực thi nghiêm ngặt các quy định ra vào.|Manner adverb.|0
strictly|only|ADVERB|Only and exclusively|Only for the stated purpose or people.|chỉ; hoàn toàn dành riêng|This cupboard is strictly for cleaning supplies.|Tủ này chỉ dành cho đồ dùng vệ sinh.|Strictly for; exclusivity.|1
supply chain|processes|NOUN|Production and distribution network|The linked processes and organizations that bring goods from production to users.|chuỗi cung ứng|A delay at the port affected the supply chain.|Sự chậm trễ tại cảng ảnh hưởng đến chuỗi cung ứng.|Countable multiword noun.|-
